OL,3,AMore than 50 Labour MPs and peers call
OL,4,Afor new assisted dying legislation
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 50 Labour MPs and peers have
OL,7,Fwritten to Prime Minister Andy Burnham
OL,8,Fcalling for new assisted dying
OL,9,Flegislation within the next decade.
OL,11,FMPs in September rejected proposals to
OL,12,Flegalise assisted dying in England and
OL,13,FWales, bringing to an end the latest
OL,14,Feffort to change the law.
OL,16,FBut the Labour signatories to a new
OL,17,Fletter say that fresh legislation
OL,18,Fshould be brought forward within the
OL,19,Ftimescale of the Prime Minister's Ten
OL,20,FYear Plan, which will be published next
OL,21,Fmonth.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,0,100
