OL,3,AMore than 50 Labour MPs and peers call
OL,4,Afor new assisted dying legislation
OL,5,
OL,6,FDowning Street told the BBC it was down
OL,7,Fto parliament rather than the
OL,8,Fgovernment to decide if the law should
OL,9,Fchange, and Burnham's priority is the
OL,10,Fimprovement of palliative and social
OL,11,Fcare.
